Subject: [PATCH] Expose guarded abort-only runtime block assembly

Use private authenticated profiles and store under the runtime busy guard, preserve epochs and selection after previews, classify allocation refusal and invalidate authority on storage failure. Link assembler nonce dependencies and register full-tree signed assembly checks. Focused wrapper tests cover exact bytes, stale/capacity results, Busy/Closed output preservation, recovery fences and selector preservation.
